{"about_the_game":"<p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >Chemistower is a chemistry inspired tower defense game where you create compounds by combining atoms and fight against antimatter enemies.</p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" > </p><h2 class=\"bb_tag\" ><strong>Construct Chemical Compounds</strong></h2><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ><span class=\"bb_img_ctn\"><video class=\"bb_img\" autoplay muted loop playsinline poster=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/3702450/extras/e9f76edb92edd6c336158bb0ac988fb4.poster.avif?t=1773255320\" width=1000 height=300 ><source src=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/3702450/extras/e9f76edb92edd6c336158bb0ac988fb4.webm?t=1773255320\" type=\"video/webm; codecs=vp9\"><source src=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/3702450/extras/e9f76edb92edd6c336158bb0ac988fb4.mp4?t=1773255320\" type=\"video/mp4\"></video></span></p><ul class=\"bb_ul\"><li><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >Employ 25 unique atoms to create 50+ compounds.</p></li><li><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >Access special damage types (acid, poison, alkaline) and unique firing patterns.</p></li><li><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >Create towers that are inspired by properties of real life chemical compounds.</p></li></ul><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ></p><h2 class=\"bb_tag\" ><strong>Defeat Antimatter Enemies</strong></h2><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ><span class=\"bb_img_ctn\"><video class=\"bb_img\" autoplay muted loop playsinline poster=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/3702450/extras/7f0a7479cd0361f9721a6610116dcb83.poster.avif?t=1773255320\" width=1000 height=300 ><source src=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/3702450/extras/7f0a7479cd0361f9721a6610116dcb83.webm?t=1773255320\" type=\"video/webm; codecs=vp9\"><source src=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/3702450/extras/7f0a7479cd0361f9721a6610116dcb83.mp4?t=1773255320\" type=\"video/mp4\"></video></span></p><ul class=\"bb_ul\"><li><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >Fight infinite waves of antimatter and see how long you can survive.</p></li><li><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >Face off against dark-matter enemies that require xenon detection.</p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ></p></li></ul><h2 class=\"bb_tag\" ><strong>Explore Chemical Reactions</strong></h2><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ><span class=\"bb_img_ctn\"><video class=\"bb_img\" autoplay muted loop playsinline poster=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/3702450/extras/56d99a6cd2782b047550e1f576848b7c.poster.avif?t=1773255320\" width=1000 height=300 ><source src=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/3702450/extras/56d99a6cd2782b047550e1f576848b7c.webm?t=1773255320\" type=\"video/webm; codecs=vp9\"><source src=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/3702450/extras/56d99a6cd2782b047550e1f576848b7c.mp4?t=1773255320\" type=\"video/mp4\"></video></span></p><ul class=\"bb_ul\"><li><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >Combine oxygen or water with volatile compounds to create explosions.</p></li><li><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >Neutralize enemy shields with acid and alkaline damage types.</p></li><li><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >Create unstable radioactive isotopes to deal AoE damage to enemies.</p></li></ul><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ></p><h2 class=\"bb_tag\" ><strong>Research New Atoms &amp; Mechanics</strong></h2><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ><span class=\"bb_img_ctn\"><video class=\"bb_img\" autoplay muted loop playsinline poster=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/3702450/extras/fdf93da9cf111089818d904948973fc7.poster.avif?t=1773255320\" width=1000 height=300 ><source src=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/3702450/extras/fdf93da9cf111089818d904948973fc7.webm?t=1773255320\" type=\"video/webm; codecs=vp9\"><source src=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/3702450/extras/fdf93da9cf111089818d904948973fc7.mp4?t=1773255320\" type=\"video/mp4\"></video></span></p><ul class=\"bb_ul\"><li><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >Unlock new atoms on the periodic table menu.</p></li><li><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >Invest research points in the unlock tree to power up atoms and gain access to new features.</p></li></ul><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ></p><h2 class=\"bb_tag\" ><strong>Other Features</strong></h2><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ><span class=\"bb_img_ctn\"><video class=\"bb_img\" autoplay muted loop playsinline poster=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/3702450/extras/3a73b7f1747c3d728dd40924a65200d3.poster.avif?t=1773255320\" width=1000 height=300 ><source src=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/3702450/extras/3a73b7f1747c3d728dd40924a65200d3.webm?t=1773255320\" type=\"video/webm; codecs=vp9\"><source src=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/3702450/extras/3a73b7f1747c3d728dd40924a65200d3.mp4?t=1773255320\" type=\"video/mp4\"></video></span></p><ul class=\"bb_ul\"><li><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >Play on 4 maps with unique layouts and enemy wave patterns.</p></li><li><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >Construct powerful polymers with infinite scaling.</p></li><li><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >Complete Steam achievements.</p></li><li><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >Compare your scores on a Global leaderboard.</p></li></ul>","achievements":{"highlighted":[{"name":"Map 1 Complete","path":"https://cdn.akamai.steamstatic.com/steamcommunity/public/images/apps/3702450/897ab1832bc1e83cb058b8511b0f6cbbb2c30d1a.jpg"},{"name":"Map 2 Complete","path":"https://cdn.akamai.steamstatic.com/steamcommunity/public/images/apps/3702450/cfd37a9dae150017be0e182ad57c1eb8e7ebf7ce.jpg"},{"name":"Map 3 Complete","path":"https://cdn.akamai.steamstatic.com/steamcommunity/public/images/apps/3702450/78710e367fb36975e0bb04e5fa775acb0f1f67c1.jpg"},{"name":"Map